style="margin-bottom: 12.5px"> You\u2019ve begun the process of upgrading the Control4 system of <b>{{customer.consumerName | camelize}}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t({{customer.consumerAccountName}})</b>. As a reminder, you receive a 15% discount at the time of purchase and free shipping on\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tany Control4, Pakedge, or Triad gear when you upgrade or expand an existing customer\u2019s Control4 system to OS 3. </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Don\u2019t forget these other common upgrade products</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class="half-margin-bottom"> Customer projects with legacy versions of touch screens, door stations, and speaker points aren\u2019t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcompatible with Smart Home OS 3. Use the quick categories below to add the latest versions of these products to this upgrade cart or\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclick Continue Shopping to add other products. All Control4, Pakedge, and Triad products are eligible to receive 15% off when\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tupgrading or expanding an existing customer. </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row no-margin">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="background" style="height: 125px; background-image: url();">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="background-clickable product-tabs active" c4ClickToggle="product-tabs"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t hide="product" show="product controllers" trackCategory="Cart upgrade reminder"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t trackLabel="Controllers" c4Track="Tab">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="vertically-center text-white text-center">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class="uppercase text-white">Controllers</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class="round-icon-outline"><i class="fal fa-chevron-down"></i></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="background" style="height: 125px; background-image: url();">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="background-clickable product-tabs" c4Clic